        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for dracut",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for dracut fixes the following issue\n\n- CVE-2026-6893: Root code execution via DHCP options command injection (bsc#1268322).\n\nChanges for dracut:\n\n- Update to version 059+suse.643.g1f1d880:\n * fix(network-legacy): sanitize DHCP values in dhclient-script.sh (bsc#1268322, CVE-2026-6893)\n * fix(network-legacy): add input validation to RFC 3442 route parser\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
